version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2025-01-01

abstract: "BachGen is a music generation system that produces polyphonic chorales
  in the style of J.S. Bach using a decoder-only Music Transformer architecture.
  It generates four-voice harmonic progressions token by token, outputting MIDI
  files with configurable sampling parameters."

keywords:
  - music generation
  - transformer
  - deep learning
  - Bach chorales
  - machine learning
  - generative AI
  - MIDI
  - polyphonic music
	
